---
manual: manip.after
lines: [2315, 2315]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $slot = stack { $first = para "first" }
  @go = button("Go") { $returned = $slot.after($first) { para "second" } }
end
----------- test code
button("@go").trigger_click
assert_same $slot, $returned, "after returns self"
